    "description": "PIE is an extension installer for PHP, designed as a successor to PECL and developed by the PHP Foundation. Pie is dedicated to installing PHP extensions, by downloading them or compiling them locally. \n\nIt aims at working like composer. \n\nWith the publication of PIE 1.0, in early 2026, PECL does not accept new packages, and direct authors to the PIE infrastructure.",
